gn="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top: 25px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 25px;padding-left: 20px;"><span style="color:#666666;"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Ogni fornitura deve essere conforma, non importa se hanno chiesto uno sconto, se l'ordine arriva oggi e la consegna è per domani, se devo produrre di notte e l'operatore del terzo turno non è formato. I clienti vogliono i pezzi buoni, serve </span></span></span></span><span style="color:#444444;"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>uno strumento di misura veloce ed economico</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#666666;"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> direttamente in produzione</span></span></span></span></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                                              <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-right: 20px;padding-left: 20px;"><h1 style="color:#111111;font-family:Arial;font-size:28px;color:#00933a;font-weight:bold;margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;border-top:1px solid #F3F3F3; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:20px;"><strong>I produttori conoscono bene le richieste del mercato.</strong></h1></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                                              <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-right: 20px;padding-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#444444;"><span style="line-height: 1.5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>Per questo progettiamo macchine di misura ottica per l'officina.</strong></span></span></span><br /><br /><span style="color:#666666; line-height:1.5;font-size:14px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Per ridurre drasticamente i costi di controllo qualità della produzione, aiutandoti a produrre rispettando </span><span style="color:#444444;"><span style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>criteri di qualità, al giusto prezzo e nel miglior tempo</strong></span></span></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                                              <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="border: 0; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="padding-top: 40px;padding-bottom: 40px;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;">                      <div style="word-break:break-word; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; text-align:center; ">                       <div style="display: inline-block; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; ">                        <a style="direction:ltr;display:block;text-align:center;margin:0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; padding-top: 10px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 10px;padding-left: 20px; color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;border:0;background-color:#00933A;border-radius:5px;mso-padding-alt:0;" href="https://" target="_blank"><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#00933A; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-text-raise: 10px; mso-font-width: -100%;">&nbsp;</i><![endif]--><span>VISITA IL NOSTRO CATALOGO</span><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#00933A; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-text-raise: -10px; mso-font-width: -100%;">&nbsp;</i><![endif]--></a>                       </div>                      </div></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                                              <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top: 25px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 25px;padding-left: 20px;"><span style="color:#666666;"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent faucibus lobortis eros, ut cursus ex laoreet at.</span></span></span></span></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:#F0F0F0;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top: 20px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 20px;padding-left: 20px;">                      <div style="text-align: center;">                       <span style="font-size:22px;"><span style="color:#000000;"><strong>Il sistema di misura ottica digitale metrios</strong></span></span>                      </div>                      <ul>                       <li style="padding-bottom:20px"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="color:#666666;">Riduce il tempo di </span><span style="color:#444444;"><strong>misura a 2-5 secondi</strong></span><span style="color:#666666;"> (comparazione di profilo, distanze, angoli, raggi, ecc...)</span></span></li>                       <li style="padding-bottom:20px"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="color:#666666;">Ottiene </span><strong><span style="color:#444444;">risultati oggettivi</span></strong><span style="color:#666666;"> non influenzati dagli operatori</span></span></li>                       <li style="padding-bottom:20px"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="color:#666666;">Effettua test di qualità </span><span style="color:#444444;"><strong>direttamente in produzione</strong></span><span style="color:#666666;">, in fase di </span><span style="color:#444444;"><strong>accettazione</strong></span><span style="color:#666666;"> o </span><span style="color:#444444;"><strong>prima della spedizione</strong></span></span></li>                       <li style="padding-bottom:20px"><span style="line-height:1.5;"><span style="color:#444444;"><strong>Misura più pezzi<span style="color:#666666;"></span>contemporaneamente</strong></span></span></li>                       <li style="padding-bottom:20px"><span style="color:#444444;"><strong><span style="line-height:1.5;">Evita gli staffaggi</span></strong></span></li>                      </ul></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                                              <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="border: 0; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="padding-bottom: 40px;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;">                      <div style="word-break:break-word; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; text-align:center; ">                       <div style="display: inline-block; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; ">                        <a style="direction:ltr;display:block;text-align:center;margin:0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; padding-top: 10px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 10px;padding-left: 20px; color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;border:0;background-color:#000000;border-radius:5px;mso-padding-alt:0;" href="https://" target="_blank"><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#000000; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-text-raise: 10px; mso-font-width: -100%;">&nbsp;</i><![endif]--><span>SCOPRI I SISTEMI DI MISURA METRIOS</span><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#000000; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-t